immune = IMMUNE
form.settings.title = Crowd Control
form.settings.desc = How much a stun, root or slow builds a foe's immunity, and what a fixed control skips.
form.settings.heading.repeat = Repeat holds
form.settings.ramp = Immunity per landing
form.settings.ramp.hint = How much Immunity one stun, root or slow adds to a foe. When it fills, the foe shrugs those for a while, and it drains on its own. A kind can set its own on the Control Kinds screen.
form.settings.heading.fixed = Fixed controls
form.settings.fixed.note = A fixed control is an effect a mod marks to last exactly as long as it is put on for, such as a minigame's stun that must last the whole round on every server.
form.settings.fixed.immunity = Ignores immunity
form.settings.fixed.immunity.hint = On lands a fixed control whatever Immunity the foe carries: it is never stopped or shortened by it, and adds none.
form.settings.fixed.resist = Ignores resistance
form.settings.fixed.resist.hint = On keeps every stat of whoever carries it from shortening it, such as a player's control resistance.
form.settings.fixed.added = Ignores added time
form.settings.fixed.added.hint = On keeps every stat of whoever put it on from lengthening it.
form.kinds.title = Control Kinds
form.kinds.desc = How each kind of crowd control lands on a foe, and what a boss or an elite takes of it.
form.kinds.heading.repeat = On a foe
form.kinds.immune = Stopped by immunity
form.kinds.immune.hint = On means a foe that is immune to crowd control takes none of this kind.
form.kinds.shrinks = Shorter on repeat
form.kinds.shrinks.hint = On makes each one shorter the more Immunity the foe already carries, so a foe held again soon is held less.
form.kinds.ramps = Builds immunity
form.kinds.ramps.hint = On makes each one add Immunity to the foe, so a foe held over and over shrugs this kind for a while.
form.kinds.ramp = Immunity per landing
form.kinds.ramp.hint = How much Immunity one of this kind adds when it builds immunity. Leave it empty to use the Crowd Control screen's amount.
form.kinds.max = Longest hold, in seconds
form.kinds.max.hint = The longest one of this kind ever lasts on anyone, whoever put it on. Zero means no limit.
form.kinds.heading.bosses = Bosses and elites
form.kinds.boss = On a boss or an elite
form.kinds.boss.hint = What a boss or an elite takes of this kind, unless its own fight says otherwise.
form.kinds.boss.lands = Takes it from anyone
form.kinds.boss.usual = Takes an ability's own, never a talent's
form.kinds.boss.shrugs = Takes none
